id: net
name: Net
kind: gear
craftDC: Expert
# "Upon creating this Item, record your Scholarship Modifier."
records: scholarship
# "Spend 2 Actions to target a Character who is not at Long Range."
placeCost: 2
# "Make a Clash (Energy Strike/Magic Strike vs Dodge). If you win, reduce their Defense Value
# by 1(T) until the end of your next turn and make a Might Clash against that same Character.
# If you win, that target is Pinned."
snareFoundations: energy, magic
snareMark: entangled
snareCondition: pinned
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Thrown to catch someone: win a Strike against their Dodge and their Defense Value drops,
  then win a Might Clash - with your recorded Scholarship as your Might - and they are Pinned.
text: >
  Net: A grid of rope created to capture and secure a target.
  –Craft DC: Expert
  –Effects: Upon creating this Item, record your Scholarship Modifier, substitute your Might
  with this recorded Scholarship Modifier for any Might Clashes made through the effects of
  this Basic Item or the Pinned Combat Condition inflicted through it.

  Spend 2 Actions to target a Character who is not at Long Range. Make a Clash (Energy
  Strike/Magic Strike vs Dodge). If you win, reduce their Defense Value by 1(T) until the end
  of your next turn and make a Might Clash against that same Character. If you win, that
  target is Pinned.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Throw: 2 Actions, at the one character targeted, and a Clash of the thrower's Strike against
# their Dodge - Dodge only, the entry names no other answer.
#
# "Energy Strike/Magic Strike" names the Foundation the Strike is made with, because some
# effects raise the Strike of one Foundation in particular. Anyone may make it: the Strikes
# are always there, and a Score of 3 is asked only of the Attacking Profiles used through the
# Basic Attack Maneuver or a Signature Technique. Nothing in this system raises one
# Foundation's Strike yet - the Strike is one number - so the throw does not ask which. The
# first effect that does is when the Clash has to ask, and carry the answer.
#
# Won, their Defense Value drops by 1(T) - the thrower's Tier, by the table's ruling - until the
# end of the thrower's next turn: stacks of Entangled, one per Tier, on the thrower's clock.
# Then the Might Clash, and won, they are Pinned.
#
# "Substitute your Might with this recorded Scholarship Modifier for any Might Clashes made
# through the effects of this Basic Item or the Pinned Combat Condition inflicted through
# it." So the recorded Modifier is the thrower's Might in the Net's own Might Clash, and in
# every Might Clash the Pinned character makes to get free - a Pinned inflicted through the
# Net is remembered on them, with who threw it and what it recorded, until it comes off.
#
# --- What the table keeps ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# "Not at Long Range": there are no distances here. Whether it is used up the entry does not
# say, and it stays on the character.
